{"language":"en","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","送葬火环"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/en","Funereal Ring"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","对场上所有敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/en","Igor deals damage to all enemies."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，在初始位置召唤一个墓碑。敌方英雄每累计损失40%生命值，便会在该敌人最近的空地上召唤一个墓碑，墓碑会在受到3次普通攻击后消失。伊戈尔始终会站在墓碑上，并处于稳定。释放终极技能时，对场上所有目标造成150% + 20% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Igor summons a tombstone where he stands when a battle starts. Every time an enemy hero loses 40% of their HP, Igor summons another tombstone on an empty tile closest to this enemy which will disappear after receiving 3 normal attacks. Igor will always stand on the tombstone and remain steadfast. Igor deals 150% + 20% ATK damage to all enemies upon casting this skill."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":108,"end":114,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":313,"end":319,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":84,"end":86,"tooltip_key":"keyword:stable"},{"start":104,"end":118,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":287,"end":296,"tooltip_key":"keyword:stable"},{"start":309,"end":323,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至180% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 180% + 20% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至210% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 210% + 20% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至240% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 240% + 20% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至270% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 270% + 20% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","爆裂鬼气"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/en","Ghastly Explosion"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","跳到“激活”的墓碑上对周围敌人造成伤害并移除“激活”。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/en","Igor jumps onto an activated tombstone, dealing damage to nearby enemies and then deactivating the tombstone."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","场上墓碑每8秒会被“激活”，释放终极技能后，场上所有墓碑也会被“激活”。伊戈尔会跳跃到“激活”的墓碑上对1格范围内的敌人造成140% + 10% ATK伤害并移除“激活”，技能期间免疫所有伤害。如果跳跃至由终极技能“激活”的墓碑，则该次伤害额外提升50%。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Igor activates all tombstones every 8s or whenever he casts Funereal Ring. He jumps onto an activated tombstone, dealing 140% + 10% ATK damage to adjacent enemies and deactivating the tombstone. While casting this skill, Igor gains damage immunity and becomes untargetable. If he jumps onto a tombstone activated by Funereal Ring, he deals an extra 50% damage."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":66,"end":72,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":125,"end":131,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":62,"end":76,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":121,"end":135,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至150% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 150% + 10% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至160% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 160% + 10% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至170% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 170% + 10% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","碑灵替伤"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/en","Specter Guard"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","伊戈尔即将受到最后一击时，会跳到其他墓碑躲避，且在墓碑之间移动时会恢复生命值。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/en","Igor jumps onto another tombstone to dodge a fatal blow, recovering HP while moving between tombstones."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","当伊戈尔即将受到最后一击时，若场上还有其他墓碑，则会摧毁脚下的墓碑抵消该次伤害，并跳跃至其他墓碑上，技能期间免疫所有伤害。每当伊戈尔使用“爆裂鬼气”和“碑灵替伤”在墓碑间跳跃时，会回复3% + 0.8% HP的生命值。“碑灵替伤”释放6次后，每释放一次都会使得“送葬火环”召唤墓碑所需损失生命值比例提高12%。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Igor jumps onto another tombstone to dodge a fatal blow and gains damage immunity while using this skill. Each time Igor uses Ghastly Explosion or Specter Guard to jump between tombstones, he recovers 3% + 0.8% HP HP. After casting Specter Guard 6 times, each subsequent cast increases the HP loss ratio required to summon a tombstone with Funereal Ring by 12%."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":94,"end":101,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":203,"end":210,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":92,"end":104,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":201,"end":213,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","回复量提升至3.5% + 0.8% HP。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases HP recovery to 3.5% + 0.8% HP."],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":29,"end":36,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":25,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","回复量提升至4% + 0.8% HP。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases HP recovery to 4% + 0.8% HP."],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":27,"end":34,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":18,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":25,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","回复量提升至4.5% + 0.8% HP。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases HP recovery to 4.5% + 0.8% HP."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":29,"end":36,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":25,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/en","Hero Focus"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身生命汲取，首次触发“碑灵替伤”之前进一步提升生命汲取。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/en","Igor increases his Life Drain during battle, with an extra increase when triggering Specter Guard for the first time."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高7点生命汲取。且当首次触发“碑灵替伤”之前，额外提升6点生命汲取。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Igor increases his Life Drain by 7 during battle. His Life Drain is increased by an extra 6 when triggering Specter Guard for the first time."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高10点生命汲取。且当首次触发“碑灵替伤”之前，额外提升8点生命汲取。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Igor increases his Life Drain by 10 during battle. His Life Drain is increased by an extra 8 when triggering Specter Guard for the first time."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高12点生命汲取。且当首次触发“碑灵替伤”之前，额外提升10点生命汲取。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Igor increases his Life Drain by 12 during battle. His Life Drain is increased by an extra 10 when triggering Specter Guard for the first time."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","畏怖之斩"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/en","Horror Strike"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","当伊戈尔生命值百分比较高时，“爆裂鬼气”的伤害范围增加。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/en","Igor extends the range of Ghastly Explosion when his HP ratio is above a certain limit."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","若伊戈尔的生命值比例高于70%，释放“爆裂鬼气”时的伤害范围扩大1格，并会使目标的受治疗效果降低50%，持续4秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Igor extends the range of Ghastly Explosion by 1 tile and reduces the targets' healing received by 50% for 4s when his HP ratio is above 70%."],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","治疗效果降低的持续时间提升至5秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Reduces the targets' healing received for 5s."],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每次释放“碑灵替伤”后，获得一次无视限制条件便可发动本技能的效果。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Enhances Ghastly Explosion once with each cast of Specter Guard, regardless of Igor's HP ratio."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","治疗效果降低的持续时间提升至6秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Reduces the targets' healing received for 6s."],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/en","Enhance Force"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","技能“送葬火环”在战斗开始时额外创造一个墓碑。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/en","Igor summons an extra tombstone with Funereal Ring when a battle starts."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","技能“送葬火环”还会于战斗开始时在相邻敌人最多的位置额外创造一个墓碑。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Igor summons an extra tombstone with Funereal Ring on the tile with the most surrounding enemies when a battle starts."],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","萤鬼"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/en","Ghostfire Daggers"]]}